# Big-endian binary serialization and deserialization for network protocol
# wire formats. Provides read and write functions for 8/16/32/64-bit integers
# in big-endian byte order, plus zig-zag encoded variable-length integers
# (VarInt) as used by the Kafka wire protocol and Protocol Buffers.
